OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786970911
OL,3,CHomes evacuated as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Chuge fire near supermarket in
OL,5,CSaddleworth
OL,7,FFirefighters are tackling a huge blaze
OL,8,Fat an industrial site in Saddleworth.
OL,10,FResidents reported seeing huge plumes
OL,11,Fof smoke in Greenfield this morning,
OL,12,F16 August.
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService said the fire started at an
OL,16,Findustrial building near to the Tesco
OL,17,Fsupermarket in the village.
OL,19,FIt's expected that firefighters will
OL,20,Fremain at the scene for much of today
OL,21,Fas the response continues.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
