CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786970911
OL,3,CHomes evacuated as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Chuge fire near supermarket in
OL,5,CSaddleworth
OL,7,FIt's understood that more than 40
OL,8,Fnearby homes have been evacuated as a
OL,9,Fprecaution, as a result of the fire.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Greater Manchester
OL,12,FFire and Rescue Service (GMFRS) said:
OL,13,F"Just after 7.45am on Sunday 16
OL,14,FAugust, fire crews were called to
OL,15,Freports of a fire at an industrial
OL,16,Fbuilding on Chew Valley Road,
OL,17,FGreenfield.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
