OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786970911
OL,3,CHomes evacuated as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Chuge fire near supermarket in
OL,5,CSaddleworth
OL,7,F"Ten fire engines and a number of
OL,8,Fspecialist appliances from across
OL,9,FGreater Manchester are now in
OL,10,Fattendance, with firefighters working
OL,11,Fhard to bring the fire under control.
OL,13,F"Due to the amount of smoke, nearby
OL,14,Fresidents are advised to keep their
OL,15,Fwindows and doors closed. A cordon is
OL,16,Fin place and people should avoid the
OL,17,Farea if possible."
OL,19,FThe Tesco store in Greenfield is
OL,20,Ftemporarily closed due to the fire.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
