OL,3,CHomes evacuated as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Chuge fire near supermarket in
OL,5,CSaddleworth
OL,7,FA spokesperson for Tesco said: "Our
OL,8,FGreenfield Superstore is temporarily
OL,9,Fclosed due to a fire nearby. We
OL,10,Fapologise for the inconvenience."
